1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:00,815
You drag

2
00:00:00,815 --> 00:00:01,327
your nails

3
00:00:01,327 --> 00:00:02,315
down a chalkboard

4
00:00:02,315 --> 00:00:03,890
and cringe.

5
00:00:03,890 --> 00:00:04,665
Your own ear

6
00:00:04,665 --> 00:00:05,193
is making

7
00:00:05,193 --> 00:00:06,310
that screech

8
00:00:06,310 --> 00:00:07,610
LOUDER.

9
00:00:07,610 --> 00:00:08,790
The nasty part

10
00:00:08,790 --> 00:00:09,314
sits in

11
00:00:09,314 --> 00:00:10,433
one narrow band

12
00:00:10,433 --> 00:00:11,300
of pitch...

13
00:00:11,370 --> 00:00:12,372
and your ear canal

14
00:00:12,372 --> 00:00:13,724
is a tiny tube

15
00:00:13,724 --> 00:00:14,887
that boosts

16
00:00:14,887 --> 00:00:16,840
exactly that band.

17
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:17,483
Like a bottle

18
00:00:17,483 --> 00:00:18,900
you blow across.

19
00:00:18,990 --> 00:00:19,696
Then your brain's

20
00:00:19,696 --> 00:00:20,667
alarm centre

21
00:00:20,667 --> 00:00:22,590
grabs the volume knob...

22
00:00:22,590 --> 00:00:24,070
and cranks it

23
00:00:24,070 --> 00:00:24,867
UP.

24
00:00:24,980 --> 00:00:26,265
Mute that band...

25
00:00:26,265 --> 00:00:26,804
and people

26
00:00:26,804 --> 00:00:28,150
barely mind.

27
00:00:28,150 --> 00:00:29,170
Why that band?

28
00:00:29,170 --> 00:00:30,131
Nobody's sure.

29
00:00:30,131 --> 00:00:30,768
But it's where

30
00:00:30,768 --> 00:00:32,420
screams live.

31
00:00:32,792 --> 00:00:33,978
Scientists told people

32
00:00:33,978 --> 00:00:34,810
the screech

33
00:00:34,810 --> 00:00:36,703
was modern music...

34
00:00:36,703 --> 00:00:37,715
and they hated it

35
00:00:37,715 --> 00:00:38,680
less.

36
00:00:38,680 --> 00:00:39,339
Their skin

37
00:00:39,339 --> 00:00:41,333
still sweated.

38
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:41,956
Your brain

39
00:00:41,956 --> 00:00:42,578
bought it.

40
00:00:42,578 --> 00:00:44,210
Your skin...

41
00:00:44,210 --> 00:00:45,370
did not.

